# Error Handling

Purpose: typed failures and safe mapping at layer boundaries. UI presentation: [`ui-feedback.mdc`](./ui-feedback.mdc).

## Mandatory rules

- Convert exceptions to typed failures at layer boundaries.
- Map API errors per [`.cursor/api-contract.mdc`](../../.cursor/api-contract.mdc) before UI.
- Do not expose raw technical errors to users.
- Log diagnostics without secrets ([`observability.mdc`](./observability.mdc)).
- Handle startup, navigation, network, storage, validation, and permission errors explicitly.

## Failure categories

| Category | Layer behavior |
|---|---|
| network | retryable failure type |
| validation | field/form failure type |
| unauthorized | session refresh or logout trigger |
| forbidden | forbidden failure type |
| not found | not-found failure type |
| storage | safe fallback type |
| unexpected | generic failure; log stack |

